  id: lore_apse
  displayName: The Precentor's Rule
  description: Carved on the rail before the apse.
  kind: 3
  price: 0
  heal: 2
  damageBoost: 1.25
  boostBeats: 16
  teaches: 
  loreText: 'THE PRECENTOR SETS THE PACE. HE ROCKS IN SIX, THEN BENDS THE SAME BAR INTO THREE, THEN STRETCHES IT TO NINE. HE LIFTS HIS HAND A BAR BEFORE HE TURNS IT. WHEN HE TOLLS THE GREAT BELL, NO SHIELD WILL HOLD: LEAVE THE FLOOR.'
